{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Now.\" Roy claps his hands. \"If I may say something as sort of the host here, looking after the place for our friend Gil. I had a main reason for gathering people, and for this I already spoke with a few. I have my own project planned for the city, and wish to share it with you all, and see if anyone would be interested in giving me a hand.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T05:48:58.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880690335846658119","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
