{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy points towards Irynx. \"As you know, I'm a mechanic. And since recently, I'm also the next mender, following our new Warden of Waters. I can see one clear point where all these come together. I'm planning to set up a series of water purifying stations along the Hudson, to clean it of all the muck that gathered there from the invaders' operations.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T05:51:40.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880691014224977941","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
