{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"For this, I will disassemble my own airship, the Red Aphid, and was given permission to the same to Sab's The Nightningale, and Ed's The Nimble. I could always use more hands, or more resources. I will also need to talk to Edriata, the fey who lives in the river, and I hope she will approve of the plan to make it a better place. Mal, I've seen your machine yesterday, and your determination to stand there for the city. Would you be willing to join us on this effort, as you either have great engineers, or are one yourself?\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T05:54:20.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880691687394005004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
