{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I do not want anyone to feel pressured into contributing, just putting this out as an option. Many of us have fond memories of our airships, and I wouldn't want to take those away. I'm sure a lot of you also have other plans for what to do now in the city, and by all means, prioritize those. The more we spread our efforts, the sooner the city will be beautiful and a home to everyone who wishes to contribute to it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T05:55:55.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880692084523298816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
