{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Thank you.\" Roy stands up and extends a hand to Mal.\n\"I'll be honest with you. Initially, I was mostly neutral towards you, we just didn't happen to be in the same place and time enough to interact. Your actions at the time were a bit concerning, and as I was already following Gil, I kept wary of you. The incident with Pork Ragu, and the dissonance between when you gave us the task, and how it ended afterwards, was an unsettling dichotomy.\"\nHe takes a breath.\n\"But after yesterday, I'm reassured that you're a friend to the city. We might have a few things to talk about in the future, but I hope we can work towards making Arcania a great place.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T06:13:06.919000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880696410952040479","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
